## 📦 Installing skills

Skills listed here are **not bundled** in this repo. Install them before use:

1. In Cursor: **Settings → Rules → Add skill**, or use a skill marketplace /
   `npx skills find <topic>` if you use the skills CLI.
2. Copy community `SKILL.md` files into `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/` for
   project-local skills.
3. Verify the skill is available, then invoke it by ID or trigger phrase below.

Until installed, trigger phrases may still work if your agent has equivalent
built-in knowledge — but dedicated skills give more consistent results.

**Project context docs:** [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) · [`docs/POST_GENERATION_SETUP.md`](./docs/POST_GENERATION_SETUP.md)<% if (hasAuth) { %> · [`docs/NATIVE_AUTH_SETUP.md`](./docs/NATIVE_AUTH_SETUP.md)<% } %>.

